  "identifier": "discharge-documentation-generator",
  "name": "Discharge Documentation Generator",
  "description": "LLM-powered tool for generating draft clinical discharge letters from electronic health record notes. Synthesises medical notes from hospital admissions into structured discharge summaries for clinician review. Deployed at UMC Utrecht across three departments: Intensive Care Unit (ICU), Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU), and Cardiology. Built on FastAPI with Alembic for database migrations and deployment via PositConnect. Ships with model card and dataset card. Designed as a clinician-in-the-loop system — drafts require clinical review before use.",
