  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Production LLM tool for clinical discharge letter generation, actively deployed at UMC Utrecht across ICU, NICU, and Cardiology — MIT, 8 releases, 145 commits, actively maintained (May 2026). Assess rather than Adopt due to 27 stars and single-institution deployment. Includes model card and dataset card — good practice for clinical AI transparency. Clinician-in-the-loop design is the right safety posture. Relevant for any hospital seeking to reduce documentation burden with an auditable, open-source LLM tool.",
